flowchart LR
  Owner[Owner-reviewed prompt and optional image] --> Adapter[Server-side media adapter]
  Adapter --> Gemini[Gemini generateContent]
  Adapter --> Veo[Veo predictLongRunning]
  Veo --> Poll[Validated operation and bounded polling]
  Poll --> Download[Host-checked download]
  Gemini --> Bytes[Validated media bytes]
  Download --> Bytes
  Bytes --> Postgres[PostgreSQL media]
  Postgres --> UI[Storefront and owner studio]
